OL,3,GNEWSAFrom head loppings to tasty       
OL,4,Atoppings - how The Walking Dead ended  
OL,5,Aup on pizza boxes                      
OL,7,FDid you hear the one about zombies in  
OL,8,Fneed of a quick bite? If not, a        
OL,9,Ftakeaway in Shrewsbury can fill you in.
OL,11,FIts pizza boxes feature an image of the
OL,12,Fundead getting a bit peckish - but the 
OL,13,Fartwork is not via any old sketcher of 
OL,14,Fthe scary skulkers, it's direct from   
OL,15,Fthe pen of Charlie Adlard, who drew The
OL,16,FWalking Dead comics on which the hit TV
OL,17,Fseries was based.                      
OL,19,FBut why mix the munchies with his take 
OL,20,Fon moaning monsters? It's all to do    
OL,21,Fwith Adlard's personal history with the
OL,22,Fpremises.                              
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
